{"id":101,"name":"electrode","speciesId":101,"dex":101,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["electric"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":50,"defense":70,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":80,"speed":150},"abilities":[{"name":"soundproof","hidden":false},{"name":"static","hidden":false},{"name":"aftermath","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":666,"baseExp":172,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/101.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/101.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/101.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/101.ogg","genus":"Ball Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is dangerous. If it has too much electricity and has nothing to do, it amuses itself by exploding."},{"version":"silver","text":"It stores an over­ flowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode."},{"version":"crystal","text":"The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode."},{"version":"ruby","text":"ELECTRODE eats electricity in the atmosphere. On days when lightning strikes, you can see this POKéMON exploding all over the place from eating too much electricity."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"One of ELECTRODE’s characteristics is its attraction to electricity. It is a problematical POKéMON that congregates mostly at electrical power plants to feed on electricity that has just been generated."},{"version":"emerald","text":"They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they 